        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Better Than Ezra, Melvins, The End Records\n- Places: New Orleans, Baton Rouge, Montesano, Louisiana, Washington\n- Products: Artifakt\n- Concepts: alternative rock bands, compilation albums\n\nFacts:\n- The Melvins are an American rock band that formed in 1983 in Montesano, Washington.\n- Better Than Ezra formed in 1988 in Baton Rouge, Louisiana.\n- Better Than Ezra is an American alternative rock band based in New Orleans, Louisiana, and it is signed to The End Records.\n- Artifakt is a compilation album by Better Than Ezra that began being sold in 2001 only at the band's concerts and through the official Better Than Ezra merchandise website.",
